    <bpmn:task id="Bridge_2_0c0c" name="**Transition Sentence:**&#10;&#10;After enjoying their wine-inclusive room service experience at The Evanstonian, many guests find themselves too relaxed to properly care for their pets, leading them to request professional dog grooming services to ensure their canine companions receive the attention they need.&#10;&#10;This transition explains how the outcome of Process A (room service with wine/alcohol) triggers Process B (dog grooming), specifically through the mechanism of guest relaxation/intoxication leading to a need for pet care services." /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_P2B_2" sourceRef="atom_1_Task_8" targetRef="Bridge_2_0c0c" /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_B2C_2" sourceRef="Bridge_2_0c0c" targetRef="atom_2_sid-D2041E58-4148-480C-AB03-99140675C69C" /></bpmn:process>
